OL,3,GNEWSA'A bad day if the lift is out of
OL,4,Ause': Life as a wind turbine worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FWind farms are a familiar sight off the
OL,7,Fcoast of Britain, but what goes into
OL,8,Fmaintaining them? At Westermost Rough,
OL,9,Fin the North Sea, a team of workers are
OL,10,Ftasked with ensuring 35 gigantic
OL,11,Fturbines keep generating electricity.
OL,13,FThat involves climbing the turbine
OL,14,Ftowers almost 300ft (90m) high above
OL,15,Fthe water, as the BBC discovered when
OL,16,Fwe joined workers on a voyage to the
OL,17,Fsite about five miles from Withernsea,
OL,18,FEast Yorkshire.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
