OL,3,GNEWSA'A bad day if the lift is out of
OL,4,Ause': Life as a wind turbine worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen we set out on a crew transfer
OL,7,Fvessel from Grimsby docks on a bright
OL,8,FOctober morning, the sea is unusually
OL,9,Fcalm.
OL,11,F"It's like a sheet of glass," says our
OL,12,Fpilot Peter Gracey as he looks out
OL,13,Facross the calm sea.
